Azure Data Factory-
- It is ETL/ELT 
-To migrate the data we can use ADF. 
Process for migration- 
Source(sql,mongodb) contains flat,csv,http files -> ADF(ETL/ELT) [iT CONTAINS CONNECTORS FOR ALL SOURCES)-> Destination(External App or cloud, AWS, DataLake.S3)
-After Extracting Data in ADF - ETL Transformation happens, for transformation  ADF has Data Flow funcationality(behind scenes it runs spark)
